    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d201">

                <pb facs="0411" n="405" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg405"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Stevens to Mr.
                            Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Honolulu</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-02-08"><hi rendition="#italic">February 8,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The affairs of state continue to be hopeful. Hoisting flag in protection of this
                    Government was expected. Subjects who were doubtful, now for annexation. The
                    natives showed unexpected regard of the United States flag. Prudent conduct of
                    Capt. Wiltse, the officers and crew of the <hi rendition="#italic">Boston</hi>,
                    credit to the Navy. Can not send by mail.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stevens.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
